    "changes": "Quality-check fixes on v3: the roof is now two-tone (dark oak eave rows and gable edges, spruce between) with upside-down dark oak stair trim under the gable overhangs, so the overhang reads; the lone fence of the table inside is gone (the table is now a barrel with a board on it). All v3 decorations are kept.",
